<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Poem - 标签 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/tags/poem/</link><description>Poem - 标签 - 春和景明-Spaceack's Blog</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><managingEditor>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</managingEditor><webMaster>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</webMaster><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 21:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://spaceack.github.io/tags/poem/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>情人节土味情话——爱情漩涡</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20230214-%E7%88%B1%E6%83%85%E6%BC%A9%E6%B6%A1/</link><pubDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20230214-%E7%88%B1%E6%83%85%E6%BC%A9%E6%B6%A1/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>爱情漩涡</p>
<p>你的魅力与美丽令我深陷爱情漩涡(循环)</p>
<p>我对你的爱将附加到每一天！</p>
<p>如果加上一个条件，那么将会直至永远</p>
<p>当爱情从0突破1的那一刻</p>
<p>我想让时间过得慢些再慢些</p>]]></description></item><item><title>情人节遥寄</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20200219-%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82%E9%81%A5%E5%AF%84/</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2020 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20200219-%E6%83%85%E4%BA%BA%E8%8A%82%E9%81%A5%E5%AF%84/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>自惜别年终，相约从容，庆元夜之火红，守佳节之欢融。</p>
<p>奈何疫情冲冲，来势汹汹，似山海之相隔，如日月之无穷。</p>
<p>纵牵念之深重，为时势之摆弄。</p>
<p>然风起纸鸢，牵牵不断，且思且盼，情意绵绵。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>靠近爱人</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20200214-%E9%9D%A0%E8%BF%91%E7%88%B1%E4%BA%BA/</link><pubDate>Fri, 14 Feb 2020 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20200214-%E9%9D%A0%E8%BF%91%E7%88%B1%E4%BA%BA/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>靠近爱人</p>
<p>我想你，当阳光洒落海面，如同你在我心中激起涟漪。</p>
<p>我想你，当月光映入清泉，如同你在我脑海留下足迹。</p>
<p>我看到你，</p>
<p>当朦胧的尘埃飞舞在遥远的山脊，</p>
<p>当流浪的行人徘徊于小桥的沉寂。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>牵着你的手</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20191105-%E7%89%B5%E7%9D%80%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%89%8B/</link><pubDate>Tue, 05 Nov 2019 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20191105-%E7%89%B5%E7%9D%80%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%89%8B/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>牵起你的手，</p>
<p>我们十指相扣。</p>
<p>看着你涨红的脸庞，</p>
<p>我没有言由。</p>
<hr>
<p>牵着你的手，</p>
<p>我们在林荫道下漫游。</p>
<p>望着你忽闪波动的目光，</p>
<p>我的灵在颤抖。</p>
<hr>
<p>牵着你的手，</p>
<p>我知道你在我的身后。</p>
<p>突然一个转身，</p>]]></description></item><item><title>七夕收到的礼物</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20190807-%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%95%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E7%89%A9/</link><pubDate>Wed, 07 Aug 2019 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20190807-%E4%B8%83%E5%A4%95%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E7%89%A9/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>回眸相识，似轻舟之聚于江洋，飞鸟之遇于穹苍。</p>
<p>若非缘起一方，则无来日悠长。</p>
<p>至于相知，则并肩携手，逍遥同游。</p>
<p>惠风和畅，尤见山水青秀，</p>
<p>烈日灼心，愈闻草木清幽。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>我如何爱你</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20190716-%E6%88%91%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%88%B1%E4%BD%A0/</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jul 2019 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20190716-%E6%88%91%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E7%88%B1%E4%BD%A0/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>我如何爱你？我细数心迹。</p>
<p>我爱你直至灵魂边际，如同寻求梦幻的恩典，存在的意义。</p>
<p>我爱你直至日常所需，无可代替，如同暖阳星光，照亮天地。</p>
<p>我爱你以自由，如同为正义战斗。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>如果没有你</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20190614-%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BD%A0/</link><pubDate>Fri, 14 Jun 2019 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20190614-%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E6%B2%A1%E6%9C%89%E4%BD%A0/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>如果没有你, 我的灵魂漫无目的。</p>
<p>如果没有你, 我的情感无处传递。</p>
<p>我将是，</p>
<p>一张僵硬枯槁的脸庞，</p>
<p>一颗停止跳动的心脏，</p>
<p>一丝丧失了温度的微弱火光。</p>
<p>若你是我眼中泪滴, 未免受分离，我将永不哭泣。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>春语</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20190406-%E6%98%A5%E8%AF%AD/</link><pubDate>Sat, 06 Apr 2019 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20190406-%E6%98%A5%E8%AF%AD/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p>四月的风，撩乱倒映水中白云的心。</p>
<p>迁徙的鸟，勾起岸旁垂杨柳的思恋。</p>
<p>迷乱的花，怎能敌四季长青的松乔。</p>
<p>暮霭晨雾，是否也是春姑娘的话语。</p>]]></description></item><item><title>美妙的生活</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20170917-%E7%BE%8E%E5%A6%99%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/</link><pubDate>Sun, 17 Sep 2017 08:03:29 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20170917-%E7%BE%8E%E5%A6%99%E7%9A%84%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/</guid><description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>生活如此美妙</li>
<li>穿过万丈乌云</li>
<li>有温暖的阳光照耀</li>
<li>还有你的微笑</li>
</ul>]]></description></item><item><title>诗词三首</title><link>https://spaceack.github.io/20100618-%E8%AF%97%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E9%A6%96/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Jun 2010 23:50:31 +0000</pubDate><author>spaceack@qq.com (Spaceack)</author><guid>https://spaceack.github.io/20100618-%E8%AF%97%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E9%A6%96/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h3 id="渔家傲-夜思语">渔家傲 夜思语</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
