    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">今宵慢慢静无息，苦茶灯下无倦意。思绪悠悠漫天际，在千里，看路漫漫已无力。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">长征遥遥仍有期，鸿鹄之志铭心记。疯狂大陆都无语，看东方，一轮红日已升起。</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
<h3 id="诉秋">诉秋</h3>
<div class="code-block code-line-numbers open" style="counter-reset: code-block 0">
    <div class="code-header language-">
        <span class="code-title"><i class="arrow fas fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="ellipses"><i class="fas fa-ellipsis-h" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
        <span class="copy" title="复制到剪贴板"><i class="far fa-copy" aria-hidden="true"></i></span>
    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">晨空破晓雁南飞，星天紫夜寒虫催。
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">孤灯独鸣漏长深，不食人间烟火味。</span></span></code></pre></div></div>
