    </div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">军训一程行千里
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">行道草树皆葱茏
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">道疏人稀心亦远
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">烈日弥阳心迷灯
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">百锻瞬息满心倦
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">百毒神香催人梦
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">子夜玉铃惊人醒
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">清风醒神益神功</span></span></code></pre></div></div>]]></description></item></channel></rss>